#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/pinning/self-referential-buffer/rust-pin.md:6
msgid "With `Pin<Ptr>`"
msgstr ""

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/pinning/self-referential-buffer/rust-pin.md:8
msgid ""
"Pinning allows Rust programmers to create a type which is much more similar "
"to C++ classes."
msgstr ""

